+Please add a new tab/section to the application called "BMI Navy Calc".Create a new component src/app/components/navy-bmi-calculator.tsx using the existing UI patterns (Shadcn UI components like Card, Input, Label, and Tabs if applicable).Implement the US Navy Body Fat Formula for men. Provide a toggle to switch between Imperial (inches) and Metric (cm) units.Formulas to use:Imperial: $\%BF = 86.010 \times \log_{10}(\text{waist} - \text{neck}) - 70.041 \times \log_{10}(\text{height}) + 36.76$Metric: $\%BF = \frac{495}{1.0324 - 0.19077 \times \log_{10}(\text{waist} - \text{neck}) + 0.15456 \times \log_{10}(\text{height})} - 450$Input Fields: Create fields for Height, Neck, and Waist.UI Details: >    * Display the resulting Body Fat Percentage clearly.Include a "Measurement Note" in the UI: "Measure neck just below the larynx (Adam's apple) angled slightly downward, and waist horizontally at the navel."Add a brief explanation that this method is preferred for lifters because it ignores total mass in favor of circumference ratios.Integration: Add this new tab to the top navigation/bubble menu in App.tsx or routes.tsx so it is easily accessible.

