+Please create a comprehensive exercise library based on the "Sample Resistance Exercises for Tactical Athletes" table.
+
+Create a new file src/app/data/exercise-library.ts (create the data directory if it doesn't exist).
+
+Structure the data as a TypeScript object or constant called EXERCISE_LIBRARY. Group the exercises into four categories: upperBody, lowerBody, trunkCore, and totalBody.
+
+Populate the categories with the following items from the provided table:
+
+Upper Body: Bench and chest press + variations, Incline/decline press, Flys, Bent-over row, Renegade DB row, Lat pulldown, Sledgehammer swing, Low pulley row, Shoulder press, Shoulder scaption, Shoulder internal/external rotation, Hyperextension press, Shrug, Upright row, Lateral raise, Front raise, Curl + variations, Preacher curl, Triceps extension, Triceps pushdown, DB jab/uppercut/cross/hook, Four-way neck, DB rotation press, Shoulder-to-shoulder press, KB side press, Wrist and reverse wrist curls, Wrist roller, Plate grab and pinch grip, Pullover.
+
+Lower Body: Back and front squats, Lunge (multidirection), Split squat, Lateral squat, Box squat, Step-up, Jump squat, Overhead squat, Overhead lunge, Good morning, Leg press, Back extension/glute-ham raise, Reverse hyperextension, Prone bent-knee hip extension, SB leg curl, Leg curl, Leg extension, Toe raise, Ankle dorsiflexion, Glute rope pull, Hip thrust/bridge, Wobble board/BOSU squat, Band-resisted step-up/walk/lateral shuffle, Hip adduction/abduction.
+
+Trunk or Core: Renegade bar rotation, DB T-rotation, Wheelbarrow drag, Turkish get-up, MB/slam ball wood chop, Russian twist, SB exchange, Cable rotation, Squat rotation press, Sit-up and press, SB rollout.
+
+Total Body (Compound): Power clean, High pull, Power snatch, Push press, Renegade clean and press, Deadlift + variations, Bear-hug deadlift (bag), Sandbag rotational deadlift, Battling rope circuit, Tire flip, Sled push/drag, KB swing, Sandbag/keg carry, Partner carry/drag, Sandbag/sled drag, Farmer's walk, Super yoke walk, Thruster, Heavy bag throw, DB loading medley.
+
+Export the library so it can be imported elsewhere in the app.
+
+Update UI: If there is a component that lists exercises (like a workout creator or a reference sheet), import this new library and display the items grouped by these categories.

